---
# Google C++ style (https://google.github.io/styleguide/cppguide.html) with two
# deliberate changes:
#   - 100 columns instead of 80: fewer awkward line breaks, still fits a side-by-side diff.
#   - Pointer alignment is fixed to the left (int* p) instead of being guessed per file,
#     so formatting never depends on what a file already looks like.
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
Standard: c++20
ColumnLimit: 100
DerivePointerAlignment: false
PointerAlignment: Left
...
